{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RZead1zti61794199698.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段車Cam片段，事發時為夜晚，一輛綠色小巴沿沙田廣善街行駛，並右轉駛入小瀝源路。當車輛駛至帝堡城對出的十字路口時，疑因後轆跣胎失去抓地力，小巴隨即在路中心出現甩尾飄移情況，車身一度偏離原定軌跡。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-09-12h41m27s420.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LVXBAdWIiu1794199725.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>面對突如其來的甩尾危機，小巴司機展現出極佳的敏銳度與駕駛技術，第一時間迅速反軚並修正車身，在極短時間內令車輛恢復穩定並繼續前行，成功避過一劫。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-09-12h41m30s562.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026581g9QAMP11794199730.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>片段於社交平台流傳後，迅速引來大批網民關注與熱議。不少網民對司機臨危不亂的救車技術大加讚賞，留言表示：「飄得靚之餘又救到部車」、「呢位司機手車知道架車開始甩尾，即時反應去反軚」，亦有網民笑言該名司機「有啲料到。」</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.499460+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T04:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:08.970482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:43.727336+00:00","content_hash":"2ac56cd90d84d806b4516324f00e8a28d9a29fac261811c3573c97ebf2feb1f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.499460+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}